dk-dsh-skills-mcp-manager combines the following installed distributions:

@michengai/dsh-skills-manager 1.4.1 — MichengAI
https://github.com/MichengAI/dsh-skills-manager
Apache-2.0; full license in vendor/skills/LICENSE.

@oh-agent/dsh-mcp-manager 0.1.6
https://github.com/wangbobo-coder/dsh-mcp-manager
MIT; full copyright and license in vendor/mcp/LICENSE.

The Skills core and discovery scanner are modified for shared recursive discovery,
policy access, filesystem access checks, and namespace-directory write protection.
The former dk-recursive-skills provider is now included as recursive-skills.js. build.js adapts the generated client
to expose both pages under one settings entry and hide unsupported nested deletes.
Backend composition and unified navigation are additions by this project.
